{"url": "https://conference.webaim.org/coc", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<title>Web Accessibility in Mind Conference: Code of Conduct</title>\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/media/favicon.ico\">\n\t<link rel=\"home\" href=\"/\">\n\t\n\t<link href=\"/media/styles.css?ver=2\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:100,400,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:300,400,400i,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\t\n</head>\n<body>\n<header>\n\t<div id=\"skiptocontent\"><a href=\"#maincontent\">skip to main content</a></div>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"icons\"><a href=\"https://webaim.org/\"><img src=\"/media/WebAIMIcon.svg\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility In Mind\"></a> <a href=\"https://pope.tech/\"><img src=\"/media/popetechIcon.svg\" alt=\"Pope Tech\"></a></div>\n\n\t<nav>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li class=\"current\"><a href=\"/speakers\">Speakers</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/schedule\">Schedule</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/register\" id=\"registerlink\">REGISTER</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</nav>\n\t\n\t<div id=\"banner\">\n\t\t<div id=\"bannertext\"><div id=\"bannerheader\">Web Accessibility in Mind Conference</div> \t\t<div id=\"subbanner\">in partnership with <img src=\"/media/popetechSmall.svg\" width=\"220\" alt=\"PopeTech\" height=\"50\"></div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"bannerreg\"><a href=\"schedule\">VIEW SCHEDULE</a></div>\n\t</div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"maincontent\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n\t<h1>Code of Conduct</h1>\n\t\n\t<p>WebAIM and Pope Tech are dedicated to providing a safe, inclusive, and welcoming virtual conference environment for attendees, regardless of gender, gender identity and expression, age, sexual orientation, disability, physical appearance, body size, race, ethnicity, or religious affiliation (or lack thereof). We do not tolerate harassment of conference participants or disruption of conference activities in any form. Sexual language and imagery is not appropriate for any conference venue, including presentations, and online media. Web Accessibility in Mind Conference participants violating these rules may be expelled from the conference without notice at the discretion of the conference organizers.</p>\n\t\n\t<p>If you are subject to or become aware of any conduct that violates this Code of Conduct please <a href=\"https://webaim.org/contact\">contact us</a> immediately.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"cta\">\n\t<p>Join us for two days of web accessibility presentations!</p>\n\t<p><a href=\"/register\">Register Now</a></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n\t<div id=\"footerresources\">\n\t\t<div><a href=\"https://webaim.org/\"><img src=\"media/WebAIM-logo-white.svg\" alt=\"WebAIM - web accessibility in mind\" width=\"350\"></a></div>\n\t\t<div><a href=\"https://pope.tech/\"><img src=\"media/popetechSmall.svg\" alt=\"Pope Tech\" width=\"220\" height=\"50\"></a></div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"footerlinks\">\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/about\">About</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/coc\">Code of Conduct</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://webaim.org/contact\">Contact Us</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</div>\n\t<div id=\"copyright\">WebAIM is a non-profit web accessibility consultancy based at Utah State University.<br>\u00a9 2024 - WebAIM</div>\n</footer>\n\n\n</body></html>", "links": [{"href": "https://conference.webaim.org/coc", "text": "skip to main content", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": null, "total_score": null}, {"href": "https://webaim.org/", "text": "", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": nu